OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA magnitude seven earthquake has hit a
OL,7,Fmountainous region in Tibet, killing at
OL,8,Fleast 16 people, according to Chinese
OL,9,Fstate media reports.
OL,11,FThe centre of the quake hit Baqen
OL,12,FCounty in the Nagqu region on Thursday
OL,13,Fnight, Xinhua reported, citing the
OL,14,Flocal emergency management bureau. The
OL,15,Fcounty is 400km north-east of Tibet's
OL,16,Fcapital, Lhasa.
OL,18,FAuthorities have declared an emergency
OL,19,Fand deployed rescue teams to the
OL,20,Faffected area, where 32 others have
OL,21,Falso been injured.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
