OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300 homes had collapsed in
OL,7,Fthe affected area, local reports said,
OL,8,Fwhile power in the region had been
OL,9,Fmostly cut off.
